flowchart TB
    Client[API client]
    Swagger[Swagger UI]

    subgraph App[TicketNest Spring Boot process]
        Correlation[CorrelationIdFilter]
        Security[Spring Security filter chain]
        Jwt[JWT authentication filter]
        Controllers[Auth / Show / Venue controllers]
        Services[Auth / OTP / Show / Venue services]
        Repositories[Spring Data JPA repositories]
        Health[Actuator health]
        Logs[Structured JSON console logs]
    end

    Postgres[(PostgreSQL 17)]
    SMTP[SMTP server\noptional]
    Twilio[Twilio Messages API\noptional]

    Client -->|HTTP/HTTPS + optional bearer JWT| Correlation
    Swagger -->|API requests| Correlation
    Correlation --> Security
    Security --> Jwt
    Jwt --> Controllers
    Security --> Health
    Controllers --> Services
    Services --> Repositories
    Repositories -->|JPA / JDBC| Postgres
    Services -->|email OTP when enabled| SMTP
    Services -->|SMS OTP when enabled| Twilio
    Correlation -. completion event .-> Logs

    note[Booking, payment, and notification currently have entities only,\nthere are no runtime services/controllers or external payment/notification components.]
    note -.-> Repositories
